script 6 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	"무, 무슨 뜻이야?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = QueenTia
	"호시카와 스바루와 그 친구들에게\n너무 정이 들어 버렸어.\n그래서 약해진 거야..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그만 좀 해!!\n내가 록맨을\n끝장내겠어..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그리고 우리의 소원을\n이뤄 줄 거야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = QueenTia
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	"걱정 마, 누나!\n나만 믿어!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그 녀석들 따위는\n아무래도 상관없어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"원한다면 지금 당장 내가\n록맨을 쓰러뜨리는 걸 보여 줄게!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = QueenTia
	"...그것도 재미있겠군..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
